    fix(search): ?contains= finds FTS-stopword terms via opt-in literal pass (DF-0926-03)
    
    Stopword-only queries (hello/from/different) never reached any candidate
    pass: dropStopwords emptied the token set and the BM25 block was skipped,
    so ?contains= silently missed content stored verbatim. Add an opt-in
    raw-text word-boundary pass (includeStopwordLiterals) enabled only on the
    contains= call sites, keeping the RETR-002 hybrid fusion contract intact.
    
    Regression suite: src/search/search-stopword-contains-df092603.test.ts
    (6 tests, RED-GREEN verified). AGENTS.md counts synced to live 183/1458.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
